{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"bb0f9571cb133e8b8b65e640f4e9676bae96cfaf3b17b6b84e2d0886a83b9354","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Half-float precision stalls GPU adaptation, and the flare-lit meadow already falls within normal range, so adaptation isn't the fix there. I'll shelve the eye adaptation work (saved to the scratchpad) and move on to the fire smoke.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Cfg1iWAj2LUdTGJDZin4wk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && cp fun/hedgerow/js/post.js REDACTED.js && git checkout fun/hedgerow/js/post.js && git status --short && sed -n 606,650p fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js","description":"Shelve the adaptation; read the fire smoke code"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
