","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"59554c11-1d8a-4790-ab7b-a38111d3f032","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VnL6D6Wp8X5n38gmPTwhrC","type":"tool_result","content":"36\tthem and the water browner in the shallows of the ford, a forest floor of last year's leaves with moss in the\n37\tdamp, leaves and litter in the gutters, brick bits round the shelled houses,\n38\tstones and fallen branches along the lane and the forest track — rain in fine\n39\tstreaks, falling in sheets far down the street, lit by lamps, fires and flares,\n40\thalos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, a low\n41\tcloud deck rolling overhead, its bellies lit orange from below over the\n42\tburning farms, whose smoke climbs into it in leaning columns, and caught by the flashes of a distant barrage, searchlights sweeping\n43\tthe cloud over the front and flak tracer going up into it, and every half minute\n44\tor so an illumination flare going up over the front and sinking under its\n45\tparachute, lighting the cloud, glittering on the wet cobbles and laying long\n46\tshadows of houses, walls, soldiers and trees (dappled under the crowns) that\n47\tswing as it drifts, its light hanging in the rain in shafts between the roofs."}]},"uuid":"33030b22-abbf-4ddd-9adb-2cd990b98bab","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:01:20.918Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","content":"them and the water browner in the shallows of the ford, a forest floor of last year's leaves with moss in the\ndamp, leaves and litter in the gutters, brick bits round the shelled houses,\nstones and fallen branches along the lane and the forest track — rain in fine\nstreaks, falling in sheets far down the street, lit by lamps, fires and flares,\nhalos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, a low\ncloud deck rolling overhead, its bellies lit orange from below over the\nburning farms, whose smoke climbs into it in leaning columns, and caught by the flashes of a distant barrage, searchlights sweeping\nthe cloud over the front and flak tracer going up into it, and every half minute\nor so an illumination flare going up over the front and sinking under its\nparachute, lighting the cloud, glittering on the wet cobbles and laying long\nshadows of houses, walls, soldiers and trees (dappled under the crowns) that\nswing as it drifts, its light hanging in the rain in shafts between the roofs.","numLines":12,"startLine":36,"totalLines":265}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"59554c11-1d8a-4790-ab7b-a38111d3f032","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
