ling overhead, its bellies lit orange from below over the\nburning farms, whose smoke climbs into it in leaning columns, and caught by the flashes of a distant barrage, searchlights sweeping\nthe cloud over the front and flak tracer going up into it, and every half minute","new_string":"cloud deck rolling overhead, its bellies lit orange from below over the\nburning farms, whose smoke climbs into it in leaning columns, and caught by\nthe flashes of a distant barrage, searchlights sweeping\nthe cloud over the front and flak tracer going up into it, and every half minute"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"15f75215-7070-4f00-b898-1322735910c0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFfNNUExohhpKsEDxGwk","requestRef":"64003444-c53b-4f92-a520-a27142766431","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4090035-880a-4e27-b7dd-2e0447c3b1f1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:01:24.562Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"c4090035-880a-4e27-b7dd-2e0447c3b1f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFfNNyVeHhzAw7ZXaUDU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016zhdyF91wELG7FmRCsbLWb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/plumes.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: smoke plumes climbing from the fires\n\nThe fires' smoke (effects.js particles) rose a dozen metres and was gone;\nfrom anywhere further than the next street the burning farms showed no\nsmoke at all. Now each fire carries a plume ~90 m tall (plumes.js, new):\none instanced ribbon per fire, turned to the camera about an axis that\nleans downwind more the higher it climbs and sways a little, widening as\nit goes. Its smoke is worked out in the shader: billows of noise sized in\nmetres rising through a column that is ragged at its edges, comes out of\nthe particle smoke and thins away above; dark grey against the glowing\ncloud deck, lit orange from below by its fire (flickering with it), and\nby a burning flare and by lightning; fading into the haze with distance\nand right at the eye. Drawn with the late particles, before the rain,\nhidden behind what stands in front and soft where it meets it.\n\n~0.1-0.3 ms with a column across the view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the smoke plumes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_read_input_tokens":492024,"output_tokens":968,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":492024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":598,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":598},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016zhdyF91wELG7FmRCsbLWb":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/plumes.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: smoke plumes climbing from the fires\n\nThe fires' smoke (effects.js particles) rose a dozen metres and was gone;\nfrom anywhere further than the next street the burning farms showed no\nsmoke at all. Now each fire carries a plume ~90 m tall (plumes.js, new):\none instanced ribbon per fire, turned to the camera about an axis that\nleans downwind more the higher it climbs and sways a little, widening as\nit goes. Its smoke is worked out in the shader: billows of noise sized in\nmetres rising through a column that is ragged at its edges, comes out of\nthe particle smoke and thins away above; dark grey against the glowing\ncloud deck, lit orange from below by its fire (flickering with it), and\nby a burning flare and by lightning; fading into the haze with distance\nand right at the eye. Drawn with the late particles, before the rain,\nhidden behind what stands in front and soft where it meets it.\n\n~0.1-0.3 ms with a column across the view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the smoke plumes"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"15f75215-7070-4f00-b898-1322735910c0","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFfNNUExohhpKsEDxGwk","requestRef":"64003444-c53b-4f92-a520-a27142766431","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b661639d-ed2d-4a7d-8940-27a33cea494a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:01:29.542Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
