ched, it uses the default).\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"fb1d91dd-47bc-44a8-aacd-a2707be449b3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFgmLzh8rzKohQLyfzqG","requestRef":"0afc576a-654d-4659-9067-13089973f964","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3f61f305-1afb-4c1d-949d-83fe79aeac9e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:19:43.872Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"3f61f305-1afb-4c1d-949d-83fe79aeac9e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017gt3MCz6yubfqrsSxA6g5i","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"4031f96c-d149-4c46-9bd2-e2925bc1bd14","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:19:44.276Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","oldString":"  blades less glossy (terrain.js grass splat gets a third of the wet gloss; grass.js 0.42->0.55).\n","newString":"  blades less glossy (terrain.js grass splat gets a third of the wet gloss; grass.js 0.42->0.55).\n- 44873e66 lights.js flash() default fog 1 -> 0.25 (muzzle flashes no longer fill the view with\n  haze; player.js untouched, it uses the default).\n","originalFile":"# hedgerow-grass session (graphics rounds)\n\nBranch `hedgerow-grass`, worktree `.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass`.\n\nMerged into hedgerow-poc already (a5c4deff):\n- meadow grass (grass.js), ground relief near the eye (terrain.js parallax)\n- stones and twigs (clutter.js + groundmap.js), grass culled to the view\n- close-up bark and moss on tree trunks (materials.js)\n\nOn hedgerow-grass, not yet in hedgerow-poc (all three merge cleanly onto d65f16e9):\n- 0f66dad5 illumination flares over the front: flares.js (new); small hooks in lights.js\n  (far / noLight lights), volumetric.js (per-light fog factor), sky.js (flare glow),\n  effects.js (launch streak), audio.js (pop), main.js (wiring, castShadows extended for\n  flare shadows, shader warm-up at mission start).\n- 09e7b09c flare light in shafts (shafts.js, new; volumetric.js lays it on) and tree crowns\n  casting under the flare (flares.js castersOf: leaf cards with an alpha-cut depth material).\n- 2c09b946 temporal anti-aliasing (taa.js, new): main.js jitters the projection around\n  renderer.render (taa.jitter()/restore()); the chain is now\n  [particles, ssao, ssr, shafts, volumetric, taa, late (additive particles + rain), dof, bloom, grade].\n  effects.js gets a late pass (useLate), weather.js can draw the rain in it (drawLate).\n  Note for camera/first-person work: anything rendered nearer than 1.2 m is treated as moving\n  with the camera (not reprojected); a camera jump over 2 m resets the history.\n- d57e5389 heat haze over the nearest fires and blast shockwave rings (distort.js, new; after\n  taa and the late pass in the chain; effects.js records shocks). Also leaves anything nearer\n  than 1.2 m (the rifle) untouched.\n\n- 3d5edb83 lightning throws hard shadows (flares.js lightning(): the flare's shadowed light,\n  driven from weather.js flashDir when no flare burns; lights.js hemi/key boosts cut).\n- 218c39a5 fires burn as flame (flames.js, new: shader flame billboards, drawn in the late pass;\n  effects.js setFlameShare thins the sprite flames).\n- df6bc348 the river laps its banks; shallows at the ford (materials.js water shader reads the\n  ground map height through shared.grassMap's alpha).\n\n- e0615fa2 rain runs down the walls (materials.js addWeather `streaks`; excluded for soldiers,\n  kit and weapons by name, and for anything skinned).\n- a0b204b2 FIX — merge together with 2c09b946 (TAA), never TAA alone: TAA is the second swapping\n  pass and writes into the scene target, whose depth three clears before drawing; everything after\n  it (late particles/flames/rain occlusion, the heat haze, and the aiming DOF) read a cleared depth.\n  main.js now wraps the chain in KEEP_DEPTH / CLEAR_DEPTH passes (autoClearDepth off inside it).\n- 2839fe62 camera motion blur (motionblur.js, new; after taa; quality.blur on high/medium).\n- f93d8cf1 searchlights sweeping the cloud and flak tracer over the front (sky.js front(),\n  uniform uFront; sky only).\n- e356d66b rooms behind the lit windows (rooms.js, new: interior mapping). assets.js readSet\n  splits the village houses' lit panes (found in the baked emissive texture) into a prim of\n  their own with an aWin attribute; the static batcher reseeds them per placement;\n  materials.js adds a `rooms` variant of the baked shader. The curtains in front glow at 0.35.\n- c995938e a rolling cloud deck lit from below by the fires (sky.js; main.js calls\n  sky.setFires(G.effects.fires)). The sky mesh now has renderOrder 1000 (drawn after the other\n  opaque objects; every blended material is transparent:true so still drawn after it).\n- e8872629 rain in fine pixel-limited streaks plus far rain sheets (weather.js: a full-screen\n  triangle in the late pass, needs the depth uniforms; flares.js gets a `burning` getter; main.js\n  calls weather.setSkyLight with the flare's light).\n- 0fd7339d smoke plumes ~90 m over each fire (plumes.js, new; main.js creates G.plumes, draws it\n  in the late pass like flames.js, updates it per frame with the wind, lightning and the flare).\n- e2ce56a0 blasts: fireball.js (new, late pass, reads effects.blasts); combat.js explosion light\n  420->220 with a fog factor 0.12 (lights.js flash() takes a `fog` arg; flashes fade quadratically);\n  effects.js particle light cap 14->6, fewer/dimmer flame sprites, lighter dust and smoke.\n- 4cd44831 flare light eased towards a ceiling (flares.js: 3*tanh(E/3)); wet grass fields and\n  blades less glossy (terrain.js grass splat gets a third of the wet gloss; grass.js 0.42->0.55).\n\nTried and shelved: eye adaptation in the grade pass (a 1x1 half-float ping-pong stalls: the\nper-frame step is under half-float resolution; and the flare-lit meadow measures inside the\nnormal night range, so it would not have tamed that glare). WIP copy in the session scratchpad.\n\nObserved, not fixed (pre-existing, invisible): adding or removing any swapping pass in the effects\nchain changes ~150 pixels by 3-7 levels along a hairline of slope 0.75 through (256,0) at\n1024x768 - some pass's rounding depends on buffer parity. Neither parity shows a visible seam.\n\nTried and dropped: raindrops beaded on rifles/outfits (unreadable at this resolution and lighting).\n\nTesting tip: a headless Chrome (playwright's chromium_headless_shell) renders on the real GPU\nwithout the browser pane; driven over CDP from a scratch script (needs the sandbox off to start).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":57,"oldLines":6,"newStart":57,"newLines":8,"lines":["   effects.js particle light cap 14->6, fewer/dimmer flame sprites, lighter dust and smoke."," - 4cd44831 flare light eased towards a ceiling (flares.js: 3*tanh(E/3)); wet grass fields and","   blades less glossy (terrain.js grass splat gets a third of the wet gloss; grass.js 0.42->0.55).","+- 44873e66 lights.js flash() default fog 1 -> 0.25 (muzzle flashes no longer fill the view with","+  haze; player.js untouched, it uses the default)."," "," Tried and shelved: eye adaptation in the grade pass (a 1x1 half-float ping-pong stalls: the"," per-frame step is under half-float resolution; and the flare-lit meadow measures inside the"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"fb1d91dd-47bc-44a8-aacd-a2707be449b3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistan